# 必考词 Unit 18 短语

## 常考短语

- **link A to B**: 把A与B联系起来 — The study links diet to health. 这项研究将饮食与健康联系起来。
- **be loaded with**: 装满了 — The truck was loaded with supplies. 卡车装满了物资。
- **be located in/at**: 位于 — The school is located in the suburbs. 学校位于郊区。
- **maintain order**: 维持秩序 — The police maintained order during the protest. 警察在抗议期间维持秩序。
- **major in**: 主修 — She majors in computer science. 她主修计算机科学。
- **manage to do**: 设法做到 — She managed to pass the exam. 她设法通过了考试。
- **in a manner**: 以…方式 — He spoke in a confident manner. 他以自信的方式说话。
- **manufacture goods**: 制造商品 — The factory manufactures electronic goods. 工厂制造电子产品。
- **by all means**: 务必；当然可以 — By all means, come to the party. 务必来参加聚会。
- **by no means**: 绝不 — This is by no means easy. 这绝非易事。
- **by means of**: 通过…手段 — He succeeded by means of hard work. 他通过努力工作取得了成功。
- **take measures**: 采取措施 — The government took measures to control inflation. 政府采取了控制通胀的措施。
- **beyond measure**: 无法衡量 — Her joy was beyond measure. 她的喜悦无法衡量。
- **show mercy to**: 对…表示仁慈 — The king showed mercy to the prisoners. 国王对囚犯表示了仁慈。
- **at the mercy of**: 任凭…摆布 — The boat was at the mercy of the waves. 小船任凭海浪摆布。
- **migrate to**: 迁移到 — Many people migrate to cities for work. 许多人为了工作迁移到城市。
- **reduce to a minimum**: 减到最低限度 — We should reduce risks to a minimum. 我们应该把风险降到最低限度。
- **moderate views**: 温和的观点 — He holds moderate views on most issues. 他在大多数问题上持温和观点。
- **a means of**: 一种…的手段 — Education is a means of improving one's life. 教育是改善生活的手段。
- **link up**: 连接 — The two companies linked up to develop the product. 两家公司联合开发产品。
